{"seq":3,"slug":"public-fame-and-final-years","title":"公众声名与晚年","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/life-and-times/public-fame-and-final-years","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"nobel-prize-and-celebrity","title":"诺贝尔奖与公众偶像","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/life-and-times/public-fame-and-final-years/nobel-prize-and-celebrity","wordCount":1490,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"challenger-and-final-years","title":"挑战者号调查与最后岁月","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/life-and-times/public-fame-and-final-years/challenger-and-final-years","wordCount":1711,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 公众声名与晚年\n\n本章讲述费曼如何从一位物理学家，成长为家喻户晓的公众偶像，以及他在生命最后阶段以一杯冰水揭示真相的著名一幕。\n\n第一篇文档讲述他因量子电动力学荣获 1965 年诺贝尔奖，以及凭借《费曼物理学讲义》与畅销回忆录跻身公众文化偶像的历程。第二篇文档讲述他在 1986 年挑战者号航天飞机事故调查中的关键作用，以及他与癌症抗争直至 1988 年离世的最后岁月。\n"}